Personal AI
===========

This project is a modified fork of **Trujillo AI Studio** by Alberto Trujillo
Mingorance, originally distributed under the MIT License. The original work is
available at https://github.com/ATM-Software-Labs/trujillo-ai-studio.

Modifications for Personal AI include: removal of multi-user accounts, OAuth,
email, Discord and Slack integrations, public sharing, market quotes and
connectors; a single-password session model; an OpenAI-compatible provider
proxy; D1-backed sync; a small tool interface; and a Pollinations image proxy.

